messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 1914
Function: libxml_xmlTextReaderSetErrorHandler
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: PyxmlTextReader_Get(pyobj_reader) is not checked for NULL. The subsequent call xmlTextReaderGetErrorHandler(reader, ...) will dereference a NULL reader when an invalid reader object is supplied from Python.

Source context:
